@startuml
title Activity Diagram: AI Recommendation Workflow

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12

start
:User requests AI recommendation;
:Retrieve user profile, workout logs,
meal logs, body records, and goals;
:Calculate workout indicators
(volume, consistency, overload);
:Calculate nutrition indicators
(calories, macros, gaps);
:Calculate calorie balance and
body progress trend;
:Calculate goal adherence and
milestone status;
:Build structured user context;
:Generate controlled prompt template;
:Send prompt to LLM / AI API;
:Receive recommendation output;

if (Pass safety and format validation?) then (Yes)
  :Store recommendation;
  :Display recommendation to user;
  :Collect user feedback;
  :Update future recommendation context;
else (No)
  :Regenerate safe fallback output
or request simplified response;
  :Store validated fallback recommendation;
  :Display fallback recommendation to user;
endif

stop
@enduml
